TEXT 0 -480 Left 3 ;GND/VCC bounce model - SN74ALVC244 QFN (RGY), IBIS component ALVC244_RGY - board ref Q1
TEXT 0 -400 Left 2 ;Driver XD_*: linear model, pull-up/pull-down resistors controlled by the input (Ron = 11 ohm, 500 ps ramp), defined in bounce_models.lib.
TEXT 0 -360 Left 2 ;Package: IBIS [Pin] R_pin and L_pin in series, C_pin split as C/2 at the die side (Cpd) and C/2 at the board side (Cpb).
TEXT 0 -320 Left 2 ;Die: C_comp split as Cup (to VCC_DIE) and Cdn (to GND_DIE). C_die = on-die VCC-GND capacitance. Shared die rails VCC_DIE / GND_DIE.
TEXT 0 -280 Left 2 ;Lines: Rs + lossless T-line (built-in tline) + receiver C_rx = IBIS input C_comp (4.21 pF, ALVC244_IN_33) + C_pin of the receiving pin. 8th line (MON): no Rs, scope 50 ohm.
TEXT 0 -240 Left 2 ;One run steps Nact = 1, 3, 7 active lines. MON=0: 8th line low -> GND bounce. MON=1: 8th line high -> VCC bounce.
TEXT 0 -200 Left 2 ;Plot V(mon_scope) (scope), V(gnd_die) / V(vcc_die) (chip rails), V(l1_rx) (timing reference).
TEXT 0 16 Left 2 ;Board supply: ideal 3.3 V at the board side of the VCC pin (R_brd, L_brd removed) and 100 nF decoupling
TEXT 608 560 Left 1 ;C73 / C79, 100 nF 0805
TEXT 784 32 Left 2 ;VCC pin 20 (IBIS): Cpb - Rp - Lp - Cpd
TEXT 784 592 Left 2 ;GND pin 10 (IBIS): Rp - Lp - Cpd
TEXT 1728 512 Left 1 ;on-die VCC-GND C
TEXT 784 864 Left 1 ;Thermal pad (pin 21) is tied to GND on the board but has no IBIS data; not modelled.
TEXT 0 992 Left 2 ;Clock: 20 MHz, 0..1 V control, 500 ps edges
TEXT 784 992 Left 2 ;8th-line control (MON)
TEXT 0 1376 Left 2 ;Simulation settings (MON: 0 = 8th line low -> GND bounce, 1 = high -> VCC bounce)
TEXT 0 1440 Left 2 !.include bounce_models.lib
TEXT 0 1480 Left 2 !.param MON=0
TEXT 0 1520 Left 2 !.step param Nact list 1 3 7
TEXT 0 1560 Left 2 !.tran 0 60n 0 5p
TEXT 0 1600 Left 2 !.options plotwinsize=0
TEXT 0 1640 Left 2 !.options method=gear
TEXT 0 1680 Left 2 !.meas TRAN GND_max MAX V(GND_DIE) FROM 4n TO 60n
TEXT 0 1720 Left 2 !.meas TRAN GND_min MIN V(GND_DIE) FROM 4n TO 60n
TEXT 0 1760 Left 2 !.meas TRAN VCC_max MAX V(VCC_DIE) FROM 4n TO 60n
TEXT 0 1800 Left 2 !.meas TRAN VCC_min MIN V(VCC_DIE) FROM 4n TO 60n
TEXT 0 1840 Left 2 !.meas TRAN MON_dc FIND V(MON_SCOPE) AT 4n
TEXT 0 1880 Left 2 !.meas TRAN MON_max MAX V(MON_SCOPE) FROM 4n TO 60n
TEXT 0 1920 Left 2 !.meas TRAN MON_min MIN V(MON_SCOPE) FROM 4n TO 60n
TEXT 0 1984 Left 2 ;.meas results: View > SPICE Error Log (one set per Nact).
TEXT 0 2024 Left 2 ;All component values are written on the components - edit them there.
TEXT 4032 272 Left 1 ;scope 50 ohm (P39, ch2 1x)
TEXT 4256 144 Left 2 ;MON: 2Y4 (pin 3) - 8th line (monitor): held at MON, input 2A4 set by J3/J6
TEXT 4256 592 Left 2 ;L1: 2Y3 (pin 5) - toggles for N=1,3,7 (2A3 <- clock bank 2, J8) | receiver Q2 2A3 (pin 15): C_rx = 4.21p + 0.13009p
TEXT 4256 1040 Left 2 ;L2: 1Y1 (pin 18) - toggles for N=3,7; Hi-Z for N=1 (1OE off) | receiver Q2 1A1 (pin 2): C_rx = 4.21p + 0.15067p
TEXT 4256 1488 Left 2 ;L3: 1Y2 (pin 16) - toggles for N=3,7; Hi-Z for N=1 (1OE off) | receiver Q2 1A2 (pin 4): C_rx = 4.21p + 0.13711p
TEXT 4256 1936 Left 2 ;L4: 1Y3 (pin 14) - toggles for N=7; quiet low N=3; Hi-Z N=1 | receiver Q2 1A3 (pin 6): C_rx = 4.21p + 0.12663p
TEXT 4256 2384 Left 2 ;L5: 1Y4 (pin 12) - toggles for N=7; quiet low N=3; Hi-Z N=1 | receiver Q2 1A4 (pin 8): C_rx = 4.21p + 0.14411p
TEXT 4256 2832 Left 2 ;L6: 2Y1 (pin 9) - toggles for N=7; quiet low for N=1,3 | receiver Q2 2A1 (pin 11): C_rx = 4.21p + 0.12629p
TEXT 4256 3280 Left 2 ;L7: 2Y2 (pin 7) - toggles for N=7; quiet low for N=1,3 | receiver Q2 2A2 (pin 13): C_rx = 4.21p + 0.15102p
